From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dcomp: CompositionEffectFactory and CompositionEffectBrush

ICompositor::CreateEffectFactory and CreateEffectFactoryWithProperties read an IGraphicsEffect description once through IGraphicsEffectD2D1Interop (IID and method order per windows-rs 0.58, generated from Microsoft's open win32metadata): the Direct2D effects, their properties and sources -- other effects, or CompositionEffectSourceParameters an effect brush binds by name. Animatable properties (Effect.Property) follow the brush's StartAnimation or its Properties. A brush draws as its Direct2D effect graph over its source brushes, each drawn into a bitmap by a device context of its own.
---
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/dcomp/effects.c
@@ -0,0 +1,831 @@
